<title>USA: Siebert offering declared effective.</title>
<headline>Siebert offering declared effective.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siebert Financial Corp said on Thursday the registration statement for its limited offering of common stock to odd lot shareholders was declared effective.</p>
<p>The offering permits shareholders to round up to the closest 100 shares any holdings of an odd amount, at a price per share of $9.375.  Siebert said many shareholders were left with odd lots after a recent merger.</p>
